<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Gencor lifts Dec qtr pre-capex net profit.</title>
<headline>Gencor lifts Dec qtr pre-capex net profit.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-Dec versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Distributable income		    68.9   vs 57.4</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			 10,455  vs 10,104 kg</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated		1,815,000 vs 1,620,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)				5.9  vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand)			   54,375  vs 54,400</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said quarter on quarter rand per kg costs decreased by 1.7 pct.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
